                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "239295541",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198066817631",
                            "num_reviews": 262,
                            "playtime_forever": 110,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 51,
                            "playtime_at_review": 59,
                            "last_played": 1793910702
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of my favorite roguelikes. It does everything so well. The adventures are short and fast, the writing is silly, the classes and mechanics are super interesting - \n\nHonestly, every person who's into game design should play this. It's such a neat package.\n\nNote: THIS IS NOT a traditional roguelike. It's a puzzle game, where you use RPG mechanics to solve issues through creative means. \n\n This game needs to be on mobile.",
